    "title": "iOS 26 Glitch Disrupts iPhone Calendar Search for Users - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago Apple’s latest mobile operating system update, iOS 26, has introduced a significant glitch affecting the Calendar app’s search functionality for a subset of iPhone users, sparking widespread frustration just days after its rollout. Reports indicate that users attempting to search for events or entries within the Calendar app encounter blank results or error messages, rendering the feature unusable for managing schedules and reminders. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
